Agreed. I'm not opposing the place structure that develops after extensive
use. What I don't like is that a word appear in a dictionary after
coinage with an arbitrary deletion of places based on a single instance
of use (or a few instances by the same speaker) to fit a "concept" that
is not what the components would suggest.

> Furthermore, to minimize our gismu and maximize their lujvo-making
